===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|harre}}, {{m|enm|herre}}, from {{inh|en|ang|heorra||hinge; cardinal point}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*herzô||hinge}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*(s)kerd-||to move, sway, swing, jump}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|herre}}, {{m|sco|harr}}, {{m|sco|har||hinge}}, {{cog|nl|harre}}, {{m|nl|her}}, {{m|nl|har||hinge}}, {{cog|is|hjarri||hinge}}, {{cog|la|cardō||hinge}}.

====Alternative forms====
